        <h2 id="cta-h">Build the future of your business with us.</h2>
        <p class="ent-lede">Start with a 90-day pilot at our cost, with no OpenShore fee. At day 90, become a customer at a founding price locked for two years, or walk away. In return, you help us shape it.</p>
